# Discord Social SDK binaries and headers. Drop the official C++ archive
# into third_party/discord-social-sdk (see README there). Never commit it.
third_party/discord-social-sdk/**
!third_party/discord-social-sdk/README.md
ExoLauncher.DiscordSocial/bin/
ExoLauncher.DiscordSocial/obj/

